DOCUMENT();
loadMacros("PGstandard.pl", "MathObjects.pl", "PGML.pl");
Context("Numeric");

BEGIN_PGML
Warm-up

1(a). Find the sum of 5 and 6.[_____]{11}

1(b). Find the product of 2 and 8.[_____]{16}

Differentiation

2(a). Differentiate the function with respect to x:
[`f(x) = \ln\left(6 \cdot x\right) + \ln\left(x\right)`].[_____]{Formula('6/(6*x)+1/x')}

2(b). Differentiate the function with respect to x:
[`f(x) = \cos\left(x + 4 + \sqrt{x}\right)`].[_____]{Formula('-(sin(x+4+sqrt(x))*(1+1/(2*sqrt(x))))')}

Logic

3(a). Let [`p = \mathsf{F},\; q = \mathsf{T},\; r = \mathsf{T}`]. Is the proposition [`\neg q \leftrightarrow \neg r`] true or false?
Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{1}

3(b). Let [`p = \mathsf{F},\; q = \mathsf{T},\; r = \mathsf{T}`]. Is the proposition [`(r \land \neg q) \oplus \neg p`] true or false?
Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{1}
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
